      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 121 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Vacations)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "I would like to tell you about what I do during my school vacations."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We have two main school vacations."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "One is during the summer and one is during the winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Summer vacation begins in July and the winter vacation begins in"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "December."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even though we don’t go to public school during these vacations,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "we still go to private academies."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "The best part is we have a lot more free time that we spend doing"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "things we like."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
